From 0e7bd595f8751a1cdb4208de99c917340ebaca3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 17:22:07 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3449/5749] fix(session-recovery): reuse signed thinking blocks
 safely

Reuse signed Anthropic thinking blocks only when they can still sort before the target message's parts, otherwise skip recovery instead of reintroducing invalid loops.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
